  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_8792.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">183 fotos desde la tarde de este s&aacute;bado a la madrugada del domingo, cuando han finalizado los festejos taurinos en el Barri de Sant Pere, en Onda, con la embolada del toro de J&oacute;venes y el del barrio que se suspendi&oacute; el jueves por la lluvia.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondissabtefestessantpere14/img_8723.jpg\" alt=\"img_8723\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondissabtefestessantpere14/img_8724.jpg\" alt=\"img_8724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondissabtefestessantpere14/img_8725.jpg\" alt=\"img_8725\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondissabtefestessantpere14/img_8727.jpg\" alt=\"img_8727\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondissabtefestessantpere14/img_8728.jpg\" alt=\"img_8728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondissabtefestessantpere14/img_8729.jpg\" alt=\"img_8729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondissabtefestessantpere14/img_8730.jpg\" alt=\"img_8730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondissabtefestessantpere14/img_8731.jpg\" alt=\"img_8731\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.de